<title>ITALY: Gross yield 6.09 percent at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 6.09 percent at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.5 trillion lire</p>
<p>auction of a first tranche of January 15, 1999 two-year Italian</p>
<p>Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Jan 15, 1999</p>
<p>Net Yield		  5.35 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		6.09 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  88.85</p>
<p>Bids			3.69 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - At the last auction of a ninth tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of October 31, 1998 CTZs on December 23, the gross yield was 6.14 percent and assigned price 89.55.</p>
</text>
